Package: parkeze-speedtest
Depends: ucode, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-uci, curl, ca-bundle, librespeed-cli
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: How fast each free uplink is, direct and through the tunnel.
 librespeed-cli against the nearest LibreSpeed public server on each wired
 and WiFi uplink, bound to its device so a test never leaves over cellular,
 and gateway-link's measurement of the WireGuard tunnel to Pulzr Net, so the
 two can be compared. Daily at the gateway's own time of night by default.
